{'symbol': 'V', 'date': '2019-10-25 19:30:00', 'title': 'Visa Inc Reports Qtrly GAAP EPS Of $1.34', 'text': "QUARTERLY NON-GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE $1.47 EXCLUDING ITEMS.QTRLY NET REVENUE OF $6.1 BILLION, UP 13%.PAYMENTS VOLUME FOR THREE MONTHS ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2019, GREW 9% OVER PRIOR YEAR ON A CONSTANT-DOLLAR BASIS - SEC FILING.CROSS-BORDER VOLUME GROWTH, ON A CONSTANT-DOLLAR BASIS, WAS 7% FOR THREE MONTHS ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2019.TOTAL PROCESSED TRANSACTIONS FOR THREE MONTHS ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2019, WERE 36.4 BILLION, UP 11%.QTRLY GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE $1.34.SEES FISCAL FULL YEAR 2020 ANNUAL NET REVENUE GROWTH OF LOW DOUBLE DIGIT ON GAAP NOMINAL-DOLLAR BASIS.SEES FISCAL FULL YEAR 2020 CLIENT INCENTIVES AS A % OF GROSS REVENUES OF 22.5% – 23.5% ON A GAAP NOMINAL-DOLLAR BASIS.VISA - CURRENT YEAR'S RESULTS INCLUDED SPECIAL ITEM OF $370 MILLION FOR LITIGATION PROVISION &  RELATED TAX BENEFIT.SEES FISCAL FY 2020 ANNUAL DILUTED CLASS A COMMON STOCK EARNINGS PER SHARE GROWTH IN MID-TEENS ON GAAP NOMINAL-DOLLAR BASIS.SEES FISCAL FY 2020 ANNUAL DILUTED CLASS A COMMON STOCK EARNINGS PER SHARE GROWTH IN MID-TEENS ON ADJUSTED CONSTANT-DOLLAR BASIS.VISA - $370 MILLION OF SPECIAL ITEM FOR LITIGATION PROVISION & RELATED TAX BENEFIT ASSOCIATED WITH INTERCHANGE MULTI-DISTRICT LITIGATION CASE.BOARD INCREASED CO'S QTRLY CASH DIVIDEND BY 20% TO $0.30 PER SHARE.Q4 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $1.43, REVENUE VIEW $6.08 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA."}
